Task 3: Assign Different Roles and Permissions
Subtask 3.1: Understanding Ansible Automation Platform Roles
Before assigning roles, let's understand the key built-in roles:

System Administrator: Full system access
System Auditor: Read-only access to all resources
Organization Admin: Full access within an organization
Project Admin: Manage projects and related resources
Inventory Admin: Manage inventories and hosts
Job Template Admin: Manage job templates and workflows
Execute: Can run job templates
Read: Read-only access to specific resources
